[15.079009, "o", "\r\n== The full path: the script gives a wrong result first and a right result second. The owner gets only the second one.\r\n\r\n$ cd apps/launcher && npx tsx --test --test-concurrency=1 test-e2e/checker.test.ts 2>&1 | grep -E '^(✔|✖)|^ℹ (tests|fail)'\r\n"]
